rago.option.quickplay_dream=Dream modes
rago.option.quickplay_dream.help=Shows Rush, Ultimate, Lucky Blocks, Armed, Voidless and Castle. Hypixel changes the Dream modes on offer: one that is not on right now is refused by the server.
rago.option.quickplay_close=Close after joining
rago.option.quickplay_close.help=Closes the menu as soon as the command is sent. Off, the menu stays open and says what was sent.
rago.option.quickplay_confirm=Confirm during a game
rago.option.quickplay_confirm.help=During a game, the first click on a mode asks for a second one, so a misclick does not make you leave.
