rago.option.nametag_scale=Size
rago.option.nametag_scale.format=%d%%
rago.option.nametag_scale.help=Size of the name tags in the world, from half of vanilla's to a quarter more. Far names still get smaller with distance, as vanilla's: never a fixed size on screen, which would show players from afar.
rago.option.nametag_mode=Orientation
rago.option.nametag_mode.3d=3D (turned to your view)
rago.option.nametag_mode.2d=2D (flat on the screen)
rago.option.nametag_mode.help=3D: like vanilla, the tag turns to face your view. 2D: the tag lies flat on your screen and stays level, even when the camera sways (walking, taking hits). Both read from any angle, in F5 too, keep the same size and are hidden by walls the same way.
# 1.6.2 : risky on Hypixel (a warning, never a lock), chat copy
rago.risk.title=Risky on Hypixel
rago.risk.note=Rago locks nothing: you choose where you use it.
rago.risk.tooltip=Risky on Hypixel: %s
rago.risk.tooltip_option=Risky on Hypixel: "%s" is on. %s
rago.risk.hit_delay_fix=This mod changes 1.8's combat timing, and Hypixel does not allow mods that give an advantage in combat.
rago.risk.block_edit_fix=This mod changes the order your clicks are handled in, and Hypixel does not allow mods that give an advantage.
rago.risk.fast_shop=This mod changes how your clicks in the shop are handled, and Hypixel does not allow mods that change how the game talks to the server.
rago.risk.auto_messages=This mod sends chat messages without you, and Hypixel does not allow automating what you do.
rago.risk.auto_text=A key that types and sends a message is a macro, and Hypixel does not allow macros.
rago.risk.tnt_see_through_walls=Hypixel does not allow seeing through blocks.
rago.risk.stats_alert_share=This option sends a chat message without you, and Hypixel does not allow automating what you do.
rago.risk.sniper_gear=This sign points out players by their armour, and Hypixel does not allow armour indicators for other players.
rago.section.chat=Chat
rago.setting.chat_copy=Copy a message into the chat with Shift + click
rago.setting.chat_copy.help=With the chat open, hold Shift and click a message: it is copied and pasted in the chat field where the cursor is, without its time and its (x2) counter. Nothing is sent until you press Enter. A message longer than the field (100 characters in the base game) is cut, and Rago tells you. On servers that use it, Shift + click on a name pastes the whole message instead of the name alone.
rago.chat.copied=Copied and pasted
rago.chat.copied_cut=Copied · cut to %s characters in the field
